


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_fd9d65d1:



    voice "d/RIN_0882"
    rin "「……好漂亮」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_996dcb4f:


    "已经是第几次对文的赞赏了呢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_78951303:


    "在夕阳的晕染下，文的裸体确实很美。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_59da4bc7:


    "从刚才开始就被伦仔细爱抚的胸部渗出了薄汗，就像撒上了一层金粉。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_2ed8efef:


    "受重力的牵引，浑圆丰满的双峰微微倾斜，乳晕则被伦的唾液染湿，闪闪发亮。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_d24b2ce0:



    voice "d/FUM_0777"
    fumi "「谢……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_39bd9ab2:


    "文笨拙地道谢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_1793c43e:


    "火热的视线正注视着她。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_eb43766f:


    "至今为止文并不是没有被伦称赞过。拥抱甚至摸胸也是家常便饭。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0c52edd4:


    "但是现在这个情况——"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0e0b764b:



    voice "d/RIN_0883"
    rin "「要习惯哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_7c8bf99c:


    "伦在两膝之间笑着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_a6d6f3a0:



    voice "d/RIN_0884"
    rin "「今后我还会说更多次的……好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_ea2d8139:



    voice "d/FUM_0778"
    fumi "「……好，我会努力的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_ccf67b64:


    "文点头回应这温柔的反击。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_2ddbead2:



    voice "d/FUM_0779"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_d6eb0dac:


    "察觉到伦正慢慢埋入自己的下腹，文不由得发出小小的娇嗔。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_060c3cc2:


    "那是至今为止没有给任何人看过的部位。文反射性地想要把腿合拢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_61d764f0:



    voice "d/RIN_0885"
    rin "「……很害羞吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_5fdb9023:


    "文闭着眼睛点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_8eb2e7cc:



    voice "d/RIN_0886"
    rin "「也对……但是……如果第一次碰浅生的人不是我的话，我可不愿意」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_cf85f69b:


    "伦将脸埋下去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_41e400ea:



    voice "d/FUM_0780"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_3afb6f6e:


    "伦的头发撩拨着大腿内侧，令文再次发出娇声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_72324d0e:



    voice "d/FUM_0781"
    fumi "「嗯……呼吸……好近……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_bde47b89:


    "伦在下腹和大腿内侧落下了吻。然后逐渐接近文的中心。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_8a060bb3:



    voice "d/FUM_0782"
    fumi "「不……要……啊啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_a8d81443:


    "文的手指紧紧地捏住了裙边。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_6540620e:


    "听到不安的声音，伦的舌尖与花瓣若即若离，彷徨在空中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_04f58931:



    voice "d/RIN_0887"
    rin "「……浅生」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_6658145a:


    "伦将文的手与自己的重合。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_f4b8342f:



    voice "d/RIN_0888"
    rin "「……没事的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_f4329d47:


    "初次结合的两个人。彼此都应该知道那是没有任何依据的话语。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_fefbccc9:



    voice "d/FUM_0783"
    fumi "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_cc29d860:


    "即使如此文还是点头了。大腿也放松下来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_3d843df4:


    "伦将脸更深地埋进去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_6e7532c9:


    "伦的舌尖小心地将闭合的花瓣推开后，左右分开的蜜裂拉出了细细银丝。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_bb10fc9b:


    "伦像是在享受舌尖的粘稠感，不断在蜜裂之中往复。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_b1e3cdec:



    voice "d/FUM_0784"
    fumi "「呼啊……嗯嗯……啊啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_58ac509d:


    "文也在伦的如此戏弄下有了激烈的反应，不时便抬起下巴喘息。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_5b84b105:



    voice "d/FUM_0785"
    fumi "「呼……绪方同学的舌头……非常舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0e7ca792:


    "因为自己的爱抚使得文有了感觉……伦不让文注意到，悄悄地握了下拳头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_af9a5b43:


    "然后抬起了脸，作为回应，她用舌尖向着前端的小肉粒移动。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_eeb31ee2:



    voice "d/FUM_0786"
    fumi "「那……那里是……啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_88ac6383:


    "刚碰到那里就像电流通过一般，让文的身体弹了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_9b7ab51e:



    voice "d/RIN_0889"
    rin "「哇！？很疼吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0bb3df7b:


    "伦被文的反应吓到抬起头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_092de3e5:



    voice "d/FUM_0787"
    fumi "「不……哈……不是的……只是太敏感了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_71315984:



    voice "d/FUM_0788"
    fumi "「所以……那个……再稍微……温柔点」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_166d5c78:



    voice "d/RIN_0890"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_e2a1484e:


    "伦点点头，再次小心翼翼地亲吻着那里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0de4ff04:



    voice "d/FUM_0789"
    fumi "「嗯……哈……呼啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_ba3e7c35:


    "溢出的甜美喘息让伦再次兴奋起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_f907030a:


    "那里再怎么擦拭都不会干涸。伦像要把整个舌头覆上去一样与之贴合，用味蕾来感受着文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_580a41c8:


    "水声大到令人惊讶。但是两个人都没有注意到吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_b6a7f9ea:



    voice "d/RIN_0891"
    rin "「啾……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_4ca706c4:


    "嘴唇收缩吮吸着文的玉珠。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_de02f53e:



    voice "d/FUM_0790"
    fumi "「啊啊……嗯嗯……不……不行……绪方同学！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_043655da:


    "伦阻止了文想要把双脚合拢的举动，更加用力地继续吮吸。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_d1288dca:



    voice "d/FUM_0791"
    fumi "「唔……不行，真的……不行的啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_36ca42f1:



    voice "d/RIN_0892"
    rin "「哇……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_5293ca75:


    "头被推开，伦惊讶地抬头看着文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_fe1ce929:



    voice "d/FUM_0792"
    fumi "「对不起……再继续……做下去的话……我就会……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_9b45c18e:



    voice "d/RIN_0893"
    rin "「什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_cdb78444:


    "伦立马露出不安的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_32697b29:



    voice "d/FUM_0793"
    fumi "「……就会去了不是吗」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_ff541370:


    "说完，文害羞地笑了一下。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_56343059:



    voice "d/RIN_0894"
    rin "「啊，啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_c4893c37:



    voice "d/RIN_0895"
    rin "「但是，那又没什么……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_5fa456b0:



    voice "d/FUM_0794"
    fumi "「是呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_cc05db08:


    "文苦笑着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_2e73fd13:



    voice "d/FUM_0795"
    fumi "「想到会被绪方同学看到奇怪的自己，突然就变得害羞了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_dcce7636:



    voice "d/RIN_0896"
    rin "「诶～～可我就是想看那个啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_c1ec9540:


    "明白并非是自己越矩之后，伦再次变得从容。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_a5e57dc1:



    voice "d/FUM_0796"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_de216573:



    voice "d/RIN_0897"
    rin "「那我接着做了。这次要做到最后。让我看看浅生，变得奇怪的样子」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_4ef5ceb7:


    "伦握着文的大腿想把头再次埋进去——"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_afff1698:



    voice "d/RIN_0898"
    rin "「姆咕！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_a0bd7c74:


    "文的膝盖从两边夹着伦的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_37a7b1c9:



    voice "d/FUM_0797"
    fumi "「不行。攻受交替哦。接下来是换我给绪方同学做了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_d5f513d1:



    voice "d/RIN_0899"
    rin "「唉？唉？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0e8b2b63:



    voice "d/FUM_0798"
    fumi "「好了，请把领带摘下来。只有我脱也太狡猾了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_2d6c9949:



    voice "d/RIN_0900"
    rin "「等一下，我还没准备——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_ceb532eb:



    voice "d/FUM_0799"
    fumi "「不等～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_bb45cd44:



    voice "d/RIN_0901"
    rin "「啊，哇，哇哇哇哇……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"
